
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Pixel Academy</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f8fafc;color:#1e293b}
header{background:#0f172a;color:white;padding:20px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}
header h2{margin:0;text-shadow:2px 2px 5px #64748b}
nav{background:#1d4ed8;padding:14px 6%;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none}
nav a:hover{filter:brightness(1.3)}
.hero{padding:45px 6%;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#dbeafe,#eff6ff)}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);text-shadow:2px 2px 3px #bfdbfe}
.hero p{line-height:1.7;color:#475569}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;background:#2563eb;color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 4px 8px #94a3b8;transition:filter .3s,box-shadow .3s}
.btn:hover{filter:brightness(1.2);box-shadow:0 7px 14px #64748b}
section{padding:32px 6%}
.cards{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:22px}
.card{flex:1 1 220px;min-width:0;background:white;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:9px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 3px 10px #cbd5e1;transition:box-shadow .3s,transform .3s}
.card:hover{box-shadow:0 12px 25px #94a3b8;transform:translateY(-5px)}
.art{height:150px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#2563eb;color:white;font-size:25px;font-weight:bold;text-shadow:2px 2px 4px #0f172a}
.card:nth-child(2) .art{background:#059669}
.card:nth-child(3) .art{background:#7c3aed}
.card:nth-child(2):hover .art{filter:grayscale(100%)}
.card:nth-child(3):hover .art{filter:brightness(1.3) saturate(1.4)}
.card-info{padding:20px}
.card-info p{line-height:1.6;color:#64748b}
.card-info a{color:#2563eb}
.label{display:block;background:#fff7ed;color:#9a3412;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:4px;padding:8px;margin-top:12px;font:12px/1.5 monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.gallery{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.gallery-item{flex:1 1 200px;height:160px;border-radius:8px;background:#0f766e;color:white;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-shadow:2px 2px 5px #0f172a;box-shadow:0 5px 12px #cbd5e1}
.gallery-item:nth-child(2){background:#be123c;filter:saturate(1.4)}
.gallery-item:nth-child(3){background:#7c3aed;filter:contrast(1.2)}
.photo-demo{padding:20px;background:#e2e8f0;border-radius:8px}
.photo-demo p{line-height:1.6}
.sample-image{width:100%;max-width:350px;height:130px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#7c3aed);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;box-shadow:0 5px 15px #94a3b8}
footer{background:#020617;color:white;text-align:center;padding:25px 6%}
@media(max-width:550px){section{padding:24px 5%}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div><h2>Pixel Academy</h2><small>Learn design with CSS</small></div>
<span>Student Practice Website</span>
</header>
<nav><a href="#home">Home</a><a href="#courses">Courses</a><a href="#gallery">Gallery</a><a href="#filters">Filters</a></nav>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<h1>Make Your Website Stand Out</h1>
<p>Learn to style cards, text and images using CSS filters and shadows.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#courses">Explore Courses</a>
<span class="label">Properties: text-shadow; box-shadow; filter: brightness()</span>
</section>
<section id="courses">
<h2>Popular Courses</h2>
<p>Move your mouse over the cards to see their shadows and movement change.</p>
<div class="cards">
<article class="card">
<div class="art">HTML</div>
<div class="card-info"><h3>HTML Basics</h3><p>Learn the structure of web pages.</p><a href="#gallery">Learn more →</a><span class="label">Properties: box-shadow; text-shadow; transition</span></div>
</article>
<article class="card">
<div class="art">CSS</div>
<div class="card-info"><h3>CSS Styling</h3><p>Explore visual styles and filters.</p><a href="#filters">Learn more →</a><span class="label">Properties: filter: grayscale(); box-shadow</span></div>
</article>
<article class="card">
<div class="art">DESIGN</div>
<div class="card-info"><h3>Web Design</h3><p>Create beautiful and clear layouts.</p><a href="#gallery">Learn more →</a><span class="label">Properties: filter: brightness(); saturate(); box-shadow</span></div>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<section id="gallery">
<h2>Design Gallery</h2>
<div class="gallery">
<div class="gallery-item">Creative Ideas</div>
<div class="gallery-item">Color Effects</div>
<div class="gallery-item">Modern Design</div>
</div>
<span class="label">Properties: text-shadow; box-shadow; filter: saturate(); contrast()</span>
</section>
<section id="filters">
<h2>Filter Demonstration</h2>
<div class="photo-demo">
<div class="sample-image">Original Design</div>
<p>The sample image is made with CSS gradients. You can apply these filters to real images too.</p>
<p><b>Grayscale:</b> <code>filter: grayscale(100%);</code></p>
<p><b>Blur:</b> <code>filter: blur(2px);</code></p>
<p><b>Brightness:</b> <code>filter: brightness(1.2);</code></p>
<p><b>Drop Shadow:</b> <code>filter: drop-shadow(4px 4px 5px #64748b);</code></p>
<span class="label">Properties: filter; box-shadow; drop-shadow()</span>
</div>
</section>
<footer><strong>Pixel Academy</strong><p>HTML + CSS Student Practice Project</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
